  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Jolt to Life.</strong> When you cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSparetheDy]{Spare the Dying}, you can modify it to send a jolt of electricity through the target, reviving it: the target regains Hit Points equal to your Artificer level, and each creature of your choice in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the target makes a Dexterity saving throw against your spell save DC, taking 2d4 Lightning damage on a failure or half as much on a success. You can modify the spell this way a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest. The Lightning damage increases by 1d4 at Artificer levels 11 (3d4) and 17 (4d4).</p><p><strong>Reanimator's Tools.</strong> You gain proficiency with Alchemist's Supplies. If you already have it, you gain proficiency with one other type of Artisan's Tools of your choice.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
